{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:37.138486+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the bug report. Can you please attach the logs with the stacktrace of the crash?","created_at":"2025-09-02T14:26:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398#issuecomment-3245590602","id":3245590602,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7Bc8hK","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3245590602/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-09-02T14:26:10Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3245590602","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185856?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superbobry","id":185856,"login":"superbobry","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTg1Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\n```python\n\ndef get_compile_options():\n    return {\n        \"xla_gpu_enable_latency_hiding_scheduler\": True,\n        \"xla_gpu_enable_triton_gemm\": False,\n        \"xla_disable_hlo_passes\": \"rematerialization,gemm-fusion-autotuner\",\n        \"xla_gpu_experimental_enable_nvshmem\": True,\n        \"xla_gpu_enable_pipelined_all_gather\": True,\n        \"xla_gpu_enable_while_loop_double_buffering\": False,\n    }\n\ndef collective_matmul_stacked(data, weights, mesh=None):\n    # Replaces this with sharding context.\n    num_devices = mesh.size\n    perm = [(i, (i + 1) % num_devices) for i in range(num_devices)]\n\n    results = jnp.zeros((data.shape[0], weights.shape[1]), dtype=data.dtype)\n\n    @jax.shard_map(\n        mesh=mesh,\n        in_specs=(P(None, None), P(None, \"i\"), P(None, None)),\n        out_specs=P(None, None),\n        check_vma=False,\n    )\n    def _collective_matmul(data, weights, results):\n        idx = jax.lax.axis_index(\"i\")\n        # Allocates a buffer for the next weights.\n        w_next = jnp.zeros_like(weights)\n\n        def _compute_and_update(data, w, results, i):\n            prev_shard_index = (idx - i + num_devices) % num_devices\n            results = jax.lax.dynamic_update_slice(\n                results, data @ w, (prev_shard_index * data.shape[0], 0)\n            )\n            return results\n\n        def _body_fn(i, carry):\n            # Double buffering for buffer reuse.\n            w_curr, w_next, data, results = carry\n            with set_xla_metadata(_use_nvshmem=\"True\"):\n                w_next = jax.lax.ppermute(w_curr, \"i\", perm)\n            results = _compute_and_update(data, w_curr, results, i)\n            return w_next, w_curr, data, results\n\n        w_curr, w_next, data, results = jax.lax.fori_loop(\n            0, num_devices - 1, _body_fn, (weights, w_next, data, results)\n        )\n        return _compute_and_update(data, w_curr, results, num_devices - 1)\n\n    return _collective_matmul(data, weights, results)\n\ncompiled = jax.jit(collective_matmul_stacked).lower(data, inputs).compile()\n\n# will crash.\ncompiled.memory_analysis().temp_size_in_bytes\n```\n\nIf you compile this function with jit.lower.compile(), and then get memory stats from the executable. The crash can be reproduced.\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\nGPU at head.","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398/comments","created_at":"2025-08-28T03:47:38Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398","id":3361668682,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc7IXv5K","number":31398,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398/timeline","title":"PJRT GPU crash for ppermute in collective memory space.","type":null,"updated_at":"2025-09-02T14:26:10Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/31398","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9438093?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yliu120/events{/privacy}","followers_url